  "body": "It's increasingly common (thanks to stuff like https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-appservice-irc/issues/387) to end up with two Matrix rooms which serve the same logical purpose which you want to combine into one.\r\n\r\nThis is the spec version of the user-facing bug at https://github.com/vector-im/riot-web/issues/2299 to track this.\r\n\r\nMy proposal is for a `m.room.redirect` state event which Admins can set to mark a room as politely requesting that clients redirect everyone trying to join the room elsewhere.",
